- The Complaint: {{ $json.complaint }}
- Sentiment Score: {{ $json.output[0].content[0].text.sentiment_score }}
- Severity Level: {{ $json.output[0].content[0].text.severity }}
- email: {{ $json.email }}

Write the email response now.

